    {
      "parameters": {
        "descriptionType": "manual",
        "toolDescription": "GOOGLE CALENDAR INSTRUCTIONS:\n\nWhen the user requests a new event:\n\n1. Extract the event name, date, start time, end time and location.\n2. Use the Google Calendar Event Create tool.\n3. Use the configured primary calendar.\n4. Convert start and end times into ISO 8601 format.\n5. Use Asia/Kolkata timezone.\n6. Add the event location.\n7. Add attendee email if requested.\n8. Return the event details and calendar link only after successful creation.\n\nDo not use Calendar Availability when the user requests event creation.",
